         rules. Plain is the only tone that prints the figure, so these carry a real
         %1$d and a doubled %% literal. That %% is correct here and must not be
         "fixed": these slots ARE passed through String.format, so %% reaches the
         screen as a single % and a lone % would crash the call. -->
